{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubicOddCarrier","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubicOddCarrier","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.prime_19_divides_both_discriminants","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.prime_19_divides_both_discriminants","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L81-L84","doc":"Both discriminants are divisible by 19 (the shared fingerprint). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal_discriminant_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal_discriminant_eq","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L74-L79","doc":"The total carrier's discriminant is `−152 = −2³·19`, sharing the prime-19\nfingerprint (a = −4, b = 3, c = −2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf_discriminant_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf_discriminant_eq","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L62-L72","doc":"**The Hopf cubic has negative discriminant `−76 = −2²·19`.** A depressed real\ncubic with negative discriminant has exactly one real root and a\ncomplex-conjugate pair — so the odd channel's arithmetic is genuinely\ncomplex (the chiral realization), not real like the amphichiral even channel.\nThe prime `19` is the arithmetic fingerprint shared with the total `C`\n(disc `−152 = −2³·19`). Stated as the exact integer discriminant of\n`y³ − 6y² + 10y − 6` (a = −6, b = 10, c = −6). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cUnknot_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cUnknot_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L58-L60","doc":"The unknot sector also gives `−2` at `y = 2`, so the total `C(2) = −4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L52-L56","doc":"**Classical (`q = 1`, `y = 2`) value of the Hopf sector is the `c_3`\nnear-match `−2`** = `J_Hopf(q=1)`. At the classical anchor the Hopf sector\nalone reproduces the empirical `c_3 ≈ −2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal_eq_cHopf_add_cUnknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal_eq_cHopf_add_cUnknot","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L46-L50","doc":"**Sector decomposition** `C = C_Hopf + C_unknot`: the cubic (degree-3 field)\nis sourced by the Hopf sector; the unknot contributes only a quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cTotal","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L43-L44","doc":"The total bar-odd carrier `C(y) = y³ − 4y² + 3y − 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cUnknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cUnknot","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L40-L41","doc":"The trivial (unknot) sector's bar-odd quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.HopfCubic.cHopf","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/HopfCubicOddCarrier.lean#L37-L38","doc":"The chiral Hopf-link (double-crossing) sector's bar-odd cubic. ","signatureChunk":0}]}